    "reference_method": "The reference creates an undirected graph by composing PPI and miRNA-target NetworkX graphs, computes normalized NetworkX degree centrality for every unified-network node, assigns types, takes the 90th-percentile threshold over all nodes, and retains nodes at or above it. It writes normalized centralities and renders genes/miRNAs with hub nodes enlarged.",
